      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s05-b1",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "The Cat licked a paw, and on they went, three together."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s05-b2",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "At the next farm a "
            },
            {
              "t": "Rooster",
              "name": "rooster"
            },
            {
              "t": " stood on the gate, crowing with all his might."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s05-b3",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "“Guests are coming on Sunday,”",
              "say": "rooster",
              "chip": true
            },
            {
              "t": " he cried, "
            },
            {
              "t": "“and the cook wants me for the soup pot! So I am crowing while I can!”",
              "say": "rooster"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s05-b4",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "“Come with us to Bremen instead. You have a fine voice!”",
              "say": "donkey",
              "chip": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "part": "part-1",
      "scene": {
        "unfolded": {
          "file": "art/scene-forest.unfolded.heic",
          "alt": "Evening at the edge of a forest under a pale sky. A donkey and a dog rest under a big tree, a cat sits on a branch and a rooster perches at the top. A small light shines far off among the trees.",
          "width": 2676,
          "height": 2160
        },
        "folded": {
          "file": "art/scene-forest.folded.heic",
          "alt": "A donkey and a dog rest under a big tree at dusk, with a cat on a branch and a rooster at the top.",
          "width": 1296,
          "height": 2160
        },
        "fallbackColors": [
          "#D9E6F2",
          "#FFE3C2",
          "#3F6B52"
        ]
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s06-b1",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "Down flew the Rooster, and on they went, four together."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s06-b2",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "But Bremen was far, too far for one day. When the sky turned pale, they stopped at the edge of a forest."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s06-b3",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "The Donkey and the Dog lay down under a big tree. The Cat climbed onto a branch. The Rooster flew to the very top."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "part": "part-1",
      "scene": {
        "unfolded": {
          "file": "art/scene-forest.unfolded.heic",
          "alt": "Evening at the edge of a forest under a pale sky. A donkey and a dog rest under a big tree, a cat sits on a branch and a rooster perches at the top. A small light shines far off among the trees.",
          "width": 2676,
          "height": 2160
        },
        "folded": {
          "file": "art/scene-forest.folded.heic",
          "alt": "A donkey and a dog rest under a big tree at dusk, with a cat on a branch and a rooster at the top.",
          "width": 1296,
          "height": 2160
        },
        "fallbackColors": [
          "#D9E6F2",
          "#FFE3C2",
          "#3F6B52"
        ]
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "s07-b1",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "From up there he saw something twinkle, far off among the trees."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s07-b2",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "“A light!”",
              "say": "rooster",
              "chip": true
            },
            {
              "t": " he crowed. "
            },
            {
              "t": "“A little yellow light! There must be a house.”",
              "say": "rooster"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s07-b3",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "“A house may have a bone in it,”",
              "say": "dog",
              "chip": true
            },
            {
              "t": " said the Dog."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s07-b4",
          "pane": "leading",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "runs": [
            {
              "t": "“And a warm fire,”",
              "say": "cat",
              "chip": true
            },
            {
              "t": " said the Cat. So up they all got and walked toward the light."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "part": "part-2",
